{"format":2,"id":"hollow","name":"The Hollow","width":256,"height":256,"mood":{"darkness":0.55,"tint":2757712,"music":"rift"},"tiles":"","decos":"","regions":["Shattered Shore","Ash Fields","Crystal Reach","Glyphwood","Ruined Causeway","Warden's Rise","The Far Shelf","A Drifted Wood","The Lost Hamlet","The Quiet Islet"],"regionMap":"AQkCAwIFAQICBgMDAgUBAgIGAwMCBQECAgYDAQIEAQICBgMBAgQBAgIGAwECBAECAgYCBwQAAggCBwQAAgg=","rift":[128,222],"portal":[128,43],"chest":[131,44],"sites":[{"kind":"boss","name":"Warden's Arena","rect":[117,60,23,21],"entry":[128.5,82.9],"center":[128.5,70.9],"gates":[[127,80],[128,80],[129,80]],"spawns":[[133.5,70.9],[132.5,74.9],[128.5,75.9],[124.5,74.9],[123.5,70.9],[124.5,66.9],[128.5,65.9],[132.5,66.9]]},{"kind":"vault","name":"The Vault","rect":[123,40,11,9],"entry":[128.5,47.9],"center":[128.5,44.9]},{"kind":"hazard","name":"The Crumbling Path","rect":[188,138,25,25],"entry":[185.5,150.9],"center":[200.5,150.9],"checkpoints":[[186.5,150.9],[198,158.9],[203,144.9]],"path":[[189,149,0,0],[190,149,0,0],[189,150,0,0],[190,150,0,0],[191,149,0,0],[191,150,0,0],[193,149,1,108],[193,150,1,108],[194,149,1,108],[194,150,1,108],[195,149,1,108],[196,150,1,206],[197,149,1,206],[197,150,1,206],[198,149,1,206],[198,150,1,206],[197,151,0,0],[198,151,0,0],[197,152,0,0],[198,152,0,0],[197,153,0,0],[198,153,0,0],[197,154,0,0],[198,155,1,150],[197,156,1,150],[198,156,1,150],[197,148,1,150],[198,148,0,0],[197,147,0,0],[198,147,0,0],[197,146,0,0],[198,146,0,0],[197,145,0,0],[198,145,0,0],[197,144,0,0],[198,144,0,0],[199,143,1,194],[199,144,1,194],[200,143,1,194],[200,144,1,194],[201,143,1,194],[204,144,1,152],[205,143,1,152],[205,144,1,152],[206,143,1,152],[206,144,1,152],[207,143,1,152],[207,144,1,152],[208,143,1,152],[209,144,1,152],[210,143,1,152],[210,144,1,152],[211,143,1,152],[211,144,1,152],[210,145,0,0],[211,145,0,0],[210,146,0,0],[211,146,0,0],[210,147,0,0],[211,147,0,0],[210,148,0,0],[211,148,0,0],[210,149,0,0],[211,149,0,0],[210,150,0,0],[211,150,0,0]],"goal":[212,143,15,15]},{"kind":"combat","name":"Glitch Nest","rect":[45,142,19,17],"entry":[65.5,150.9],"center":[54.5,150.9],"gates":[[63,149],[63,150],[63,151]],"spawns":[[48.5,145.9],[48.5,155.9],[51.5,145.9],[51.5,155.9],[54.5,145.9],[54.5,155.9],[57.5,145.9],[57.5,155.9],[60.5,145.9],[60.5,155.9],[48.5,148.9],[60.5,148.9],[48.5,151.9],[60.5,151.9],[48.5,154.9],[60.5,154.9]]},{"kind":"puzzle","name":"Glyph Hall","rect":[60,59,17,15],"entry":[68.5,75.9],"center":[68.5,66.9],"plates":[[71,67,0],[67,65,3],[73,69,5],[65,63,2],[73,65,4]],"mural":[[64,60,2],[66,60,5],[68,60,4],[70,60,0],[72,60,3]]}],"clues":[{"id":"first-stone","x":121,"y":219,"title":"I. A Stone by the Rift","pages":["Carved in a hand you almost know: \"What the world lets go of does not end. It drifts. Out past the edge of everything kept, it comes here, and so did we.\"","\"Our grandparents told us the land behind us would drift, as it always had. They were right. They never said where it went.\""]},{"id":"causeway-stone","x":128,"y":145,"title":"II. The Causeway Stone","pages":["\"The roads were old when we drifted in. Someone laid them to join one lost place to another, all the way out into the dark. A network, the elders said. Asleep. Best left asleep.\""]},{"id":"burnt-stone","x":214,"y":206,"title":"III. The Hamlet Stone","pages":["Scorched along one edge: \"For as long as anyone remembered, the Drift was a slow tide. Places went, and new ones came. You learned to say goodbye.\"","\"Then the old roads woke, and the tide began to tear. Now holes open between what is kept and what is lost, and things come through that were never part of either.\""]},{"id":"listening-stone","x":48,"y":84,"title":"IV. The Listening Stone","pages":["\"Past the furthest of the lost places there is a place where nothing has ever been. We call it the Null. It does not hate. It does not want. It only spreads, wherever the edges thin.\"","\"Hush. When the wind drops you can hear it hum.\""]},{"id":"far-stone","x":220,"y":147,"title":"V. The Stone Beyond the Path","pages":["\"The Warden was set at the crossing to keep the old roads shut. Something reached it before we did. Look at its eyes when it turns: there is nothing behind them now. Only the hum.\""]},{"id":"last-stone","x":125,"y":44,"title":"VI. The Last Stone","pages":["\"Close the tear, and the edge mends here, for a while. But the network is awake, and it did not wake by itself. Someone came looking for where the lost places go.\"","Below, newer, scratched in haste, in a hand very like your own: \"I only wanted to see.\""]},{"id":"quiet-stone","x":24,"y":19,"title":"VII. The Stone Nobody Was Meant to Find","pages":["\"The keepers of the roads wrote down every place that drifted, so that nothing would be lost entirely. Their library is past here, under black water now. If you are reading this, you found the way the keepers used.\"","Scratched beneath, in the same hurried hand as the Last Stone: \"Found their ledger. It answers when you write in it. I wrote.\""]}],"plot":{"resident":{"name":"Isolde","x":216,"y":212,"look":"hamlet-ghost"},"goal":"the hamlet's bell","relics":[{"id":"bell-crown","x":33,"y":137,"name":"bell crown"},{"id":"bell-lip","x":222,"y":153,"name":"bell lip"},{"id":"bell-clapper","x":28,"y":19,"name":"bell clapper"}],"talk":{"first":["You can see me? Then you are not from here. I am Isolde. I rang the bell of this hamlet, before it drifted. When the Drift took us we came here slowly, the whole hamlet, like falling asleep.","My father kept watch on the old road, the one with the gate. When the hum came up the road he went to meet it, and he did not come back the same. Now they call him the Warden.","The bell broke the night the tear opened. Its pieces are scattered across the Hollow: the crown, the lip, the clapper. If it rang once more, he might hear it. He might remember he was a man. Will you find them?"],"waiting":"The bell is in pieces still: {found} of {of} found. Listen as you walk. Bronze hums back when the void does.","ready":["You found them. All of them. Hold the crown steady while I set the lip… there. And the clapper.","Stand back. It has been a long time since anything here made a sound on purpose."],"after":"He heard it. I know he did. When you face him, be quick. Let him rest.","cleared":"He is at peace. The bell will ring as long as this place is remembered. Go on: there are other lost places, and other keepers waiting in them."},"restored":{"title":"The Bell Rings","pages":["The bell rings out across the void, clear and very old. Far off on Warden's Rise the Warden stops. For a heartbeat it is only a man in a watchman's coat, turning toward the sound.","Isolde listens to something you cannot hear. \"He remembers. Someone came up the road before the hum, he says. Someone with ash on their hands, asking the way into the old network. He showed them the way. He has been sorry ever since.\""]},"closing":{"title":"The Hollow Holds","pages":["The tear folds shut behind you. In the Hollow, the hamlet bell rings once more, and then the lost places are quiet for the first time since the Fracture.","But the network's roads run on past the Hollow, deeper, toward a place where every lost thing was written down. A drowned library, the stones said. The next rift you find may open there."]},"reward":{"xp":120,"items":[{"item":"rift-shard","count":2},{"item":"coin","count":40}]}},"spawns":[{"rect":[14,112,86,74],"species":["glitchling"],"cap":4},{"rect":[144,118,42,66],"species":["shard-wisp","glitchling"],"cap":3},{"rect":[30,34,80,72],"species":["glitchling","shard-wisp"],"cap":4},{"rect":[90,186,80,54],"species":["glitchling"],"cap":2},{"rect":[100,100,60,70],"species":["glitchling"],"cap":2},{"rect":[20,196,44,34],"species":["glitchling"],"cap":2},{"rect":[198,200,42,30],"species":["glitchling","shard-wisp"],"cap":2},{"rect":[100,84,56,22],"species":["null-shade","glitchling"],"cap":3},{"rect":[14,120,30,26],"species":["null-shade"],"cap":1}]}
